Specifically, for game over overlay (phase 'lost'), show "Game Over", final score, restart instructions.

Also maybe for won, show "You Win!" but the task only asks for game-over overlay. We'll implement for phase === 'lost'.

The overlay should dim background (draw translucent black rectangle across canvas). Then draw centered text: "Game Over". Then final score: `Final score ${score}` below. Then instructions: "Press R or click Restart". Use same style as reference: fillRect with alpha, text align center.

Also need to maybe include beep call? Already beep is called on collision detection.

